        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Beautiful area near the water on scenic route. Available seats and tables in shaded area. Some beverages available - I suggest adding some snacks like popsicles, ice cream, etc. Regular program of events, historical site to visit.",
